# Next.js / TSX

- Edit the **existing** App Router site; do not scaffold a second app.
- Match existing layout, tokens, and motion from the codebase and `docs/design-guidelines.md`.
- Vietnamese UI copy only unless the owner asks otherwise.
- No booking, payment, or account flows in MVP.
- Do not invent business facts in UI strings; use `docs/confirmed-content.md` / `lib/menu.ts` or label `NEEDS OWNER INPUT`.
- Prefer accessible names, one `h1` per page, sensible image `alt`.
- Honor `prefers-reduced-motion` for existing motion patterns.
